      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I researched before choosing this company. This website really helped and also Whirlpool feedback. My system is not up and running yet as I am waiting for Energex. But the experience with this company was great from beginning to end. Sales person Aaron was impressive and re-assuring. He was willing to answer questions even after I had signed the paper work. Installation was done by a great team Peter Jensen for electrical (0439 633137) and his mate Doug for panel installing. Peter especially went out of his way in regards to meter box changes and owner Ian supported him in this. This was during an extremely busy time (Dec. 12) but these guys were doing things right. There was a small paperwork mishap and we received only 12 instead of 14 panels. Again, Aaron and owner Ian took care of this issue and it was quickly resolved. I would really recommend this company and the installers. I will certainly call Peter if I need any maintenance or other electrical work done. Thank you Solaris!",
